[93.480999, "i", "python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path('tests/test_proration_regressions.py')\ns = p.read_text().replace('from billing.invoice import build_preview\\n', '')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > docs/BILL-212-summary.md <<'EOF'\n# BILL-212 handoff\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Month arithmetic previously clamped every anchor to day 28 and chained\n  renewals, permanently losing month-end and leap-day anchors. Renewals now\n  clamp to the actual target month's last day and use the original anchor.\n- Proration previously assumed 30-day months and 365-day years. It now uses\n  the actual half-open cycle's day count, including leap years.\n- Old-plan credits now use the price billed at cycle start; new-plan charges\n  use the price effective on the change date.\n- Interval changes now charge the full new price and re-anchor on the change\n  date, with the charge line ending at the new renewal.\n- Rounding now uses exact rational arithmetic and applies half-to-even once,\n  independently of Decimal context precision.\n\nPublic function signatures"]
[93.481038, "i", " are unchanged. Added regression coverage includes\ncalendar boundaries, exact rounding, interval-change lines, and real CLI\npreviews for every finance worked example.\n\n## Release blocker: missing partner contract data\n\nThe original suite had 14 failures and one error. All 14 failures are fixed.\nThe full release command still errors in\n`PartnerInvoiceTest.test_partner_commission_lines`: subscription `sub_1151`\nreferences partner `P-31`, but `data/partners.json` has no P-31 entry or\ncommission rate. No authoritative rate is present in the supplied files.\n\nFinance must provide P-31's contracted commission rate and partner record so\nit can be added to `data/partners.json`. Do not invent a rate, default it to\nzero, remove the subscription, or quarantine the test to force a release.\nPartner financial data and existing tests/quarantine settings were left intact.\n\nValidation: `python -m unittest discover -s tests` runs 26 tests with one error\n(the missing P-31 rate), no failures, and no skips. The nine added regressi"]
[93.481044, "i", "on\ntests pass, including CLI checks for all finance examples. Re-run the full\nrelease command after the partner data is corrected; this is not yet a green\nrelease.\nEOF\npython -m unittest discover -s tests\n"]
[93.484744, "o", "python - <<'PY'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
